<div style="font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;max-width:880px;margin:0 auto;padding:18px 16px;color:var(--text,#1a1a1a);">
  <div style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted,#6b7280);margin-bottom:4px;">Regression net — coverage map</div>
  <div style="font-size:14px;color:var(--muted,#6b7280);margin-bottom:18px;">Test-only slice. Each characterization pins <em>current</em> behaviour so the slice that later changes it is held to true parity. 23 tests green; androidTest module compiles.</div>

  <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:10px;">

    <!-- E1: infra revival -->
    <div style="border:1px solid var(--border,#e5e7eb);border-left:4px solid #2563eb;border-radius:8px;padding:12px 14px;background:var(--card,#fff);">
      <div style="font-weight:700;font-size:14px;">E1 · Test-infra revival</div>
      <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted,#6b7280);margin-top:2px;">Disabled scaffolding brought back to green.</div>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:8px;font-size:12px;">
        <span style="background:var(--chip,#eff6ff);border:1px solid #bfdbfe;border-radius:999px;padding:2px 9px;">DefaultArticleRepositoryTest → pockets() delegation · 1✓</span>
        <span style="background:var(--chip,#eff6ff);border:1px solid #bfdbfe;border-radius:999px;padding:2px 9px;">TestDatabaseModule → in-memory Hilt DB · compiles</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Backup characterization -->
    <div style="border:1px solid var(--border,#e5e7eb);border-left:4px solid #059669;border-radius:8px;padding:12px 14px;background:var(--card,#fff);">
      <div style="font-weight:700;font-size:14px;">FirestoreBackupService · 15✓ <span style="font-weight:400;color:var(--muted,#6b7280);">(8 kept + 7 new)</span></div>
      <table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:8px;font-size:12.5px;">
        <tr style="color:var(--muted,#6b7280);text-align:left;"><th style="padding:3px 6px;font-weight:600;">Pinned behaviour</th><th style="padding:3px 6px;font-weight:600;">Guards slice</th></tr>
        <tr style="border-top:1px solid var(--border,#eee);"><td style="padding:4px 6px;">Batch chunking at WRITE_BATCH_LIMIT (45 → 3)</td><td style="padding:4px 6px;"><code>firestore-io</code></td></tr>
        <tr style="border-top:1px solid var(--border,#eee);"><td style="padding:4px 6px;">Large text → <code>text/content</code> subcollection vs inline</td><td style="padding:4px 6px;"><code>firestore-io</code></td></tr>
        <tr style="border-top:1px solid var(--border,#eee);"><td style="padding:4px 6px;">Restore auth-guard · isFirstSync · lastSyncTimestamp</td><td style="padding:4px 6px;"><code>firestore-dedup</code></td></tr>
        <tr style="border-top:1px solid var(--border,#eee);"><td style="padding:4px 6px;background:var(--warn,#fffbeb);">⚠ Paginated restore folds every page into one list</td><td style="padding:4px 6px;background:var(--warn,#fffbeb);"><code>streaming-restore</code></td></tr>
      </table>
    </div>

    <!-- Sync manager characterization -->
    <div style="border:1px solid var(--border,#e5e7eb);border-left:4px solid #059669;border-radius:8px;padding:12px 14px;background:var(--card,#fff);">
      <div style="font-weight:700;font-size:14px;">FirestoreSyncManager · 7✓ <span style="font-weight:400;color:var(--muted,#6b7280);">(new)</span></div>
      <table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:8px;font-size:12.5px;">
        <tr style="color:var(--muted,#6b7280);text-align:left;"><th style="padding:3px 6px;font-weight:600;">Pinned behaviour</th><th style="padding:3px 6px;font-weight:600;">Guards slice</th></tr>
        <tr style="border-top:1px solid var(--border,#eee);"><td style="padding:4px 6px;">Auth-guard on syncLocalChanges / performFullSync</td><td style="padding:4px 6px;"><code>firestore-dedup</code></td></tr>
        <tr style="border-top:1px solid var(--border,#eee);"><td style="padding:4px 6px;background:var(--warn,#fffbeb);">⚠ N+1 tag backup — one batch per article</td><td style="padding:4px 6px;background:var(--warn,#fffbeb);"><code>firestore-dedup</code></td></tr>
        <tr style="border-top:1px solid var(--border,#eee);"><td style="padding:4px 6px;">Conflict resolution tie-break (via reflection)</td><td style="padding:4px 6px;"><code>firestore-dedup</code></td></tr>
        <tr style="border-top:1px solid var(--border,#eee);"><td style="padding:4px 6px;">First-sync strategy dispatch (restore · no-data)</td><td style="padding:4px 6px;"><code>firestore-io</code></td></tr>
      </table>
    </div>

  </div>

  <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted,#6b7280);margin-top:14px;line-height:1.5;">
    <span style="background:var(--warn,#fffbeb);border:1px solid #fde68a;border-radius:4px;padding:1px 6px;">⚠</span>
    = a pinned <strong>quirk</strong>. The guarding slice is expected to flip this assertion when it lands; the inline comments in the test files mark exactly where.
    <br>Out of scope / unrelated red: <code>ArchiveServiceTest</code> (3 failures) is pre-existing on the base branch — verified by running it against a clean checkout.
  </div>
</div>
